# A Taste for Meat (sandoria 100): Prog 1 by GM (the char var Quest[0][100]Prog), five slices to Thierride (528:
# completed, Option 1); with a full inventory Antreneau's 530 cannot give the Slice of Grilled Hare: Option stays 1 and
# the finish starts 538 (no handler), which the client ends; with room, 530 again gives it (Option 0). 528's completion
# cannot fail (gil, fame and a title only).
char zone=PortSanDoria pos=-65.949,-5.496,-28.792 job=WAR lvl=10
charvar Quest[0][100]Prog 1
item SliceOfHareMeat x5
login
trade Thierride SliceOfHareMeat x5        # Prog 1, exactly five: 528
finish                                    # begun and completed; Option 1
fill-inventory
trigger Antreneau                         # Option 1: 530
finish                                    # no room: giveItem false; the finish starts 538
finish-if-event                           # 538 ended (no handler)
free-inventory
trigger Antreneau                         # Option still 1: 530
finish                                    # a Slice of Grilled Hare; Option 0
